+    // RAOTA patch: on the new architecture MapKit's setRegion:animated:YES ignores the requested
+    // duration, and MapKit does not follow camera changes inside UIView animation blocks. Work out
+    // the camera that shows the region, put the old camera back, then step the camera on every
